  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Calculator</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Calculator</h1>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"left\">Left number</label>\n      <input id=\"left\" type=\"number\" step=\"any\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. -3.5\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"right\">Right number</label>\n      <input id=\"right\" type=\"number\" step=\"any\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. 2\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"operation\">Operation</label>\n      <select id=\"operation\">\n        <option value=\"add\">Add</option>\n        <option value=\"subtract\">Subtract</option>\n        <option value=\"multiply\">Multiply</option>\n        <option value=\"divide\">Divide</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n    <button id=\"calculate\" type=\"button\">Calculate</button>\n    <output id=\"result\" for=\"left right operation calculate\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</output>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1a2e;\n  --card: #16213e;\n  --accent: #e94560;\n  --text: #eaeaea;\n  --muted: #a0a0b0;\n}\n* { box-sizing: border-box; }\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: grid;\n  place-items: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n.card {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 400px;\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 4px solid var(--accent);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  padding: 24px;\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #0f0f1a;\n}\nh1 {\n  margin: 0 0 24px;\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  text-align: center;\n  color: var(--accent);\n}\n.field { margin-bottom: 16px; }\nlabel {\n  display: block;\n  margin-bottom: 6px;\n  font-size: 0.95rem;\n  color: var(--muted);\n}\ninput, select, button {\n  width: 100%;\n  font: inherit;\n  padding: 12px;\n  border: 3px solid var(--muted);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  outline: none;\n}\ninput:focus, select:focus, button:focus-visible {\n  border-color: var(--accent);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(233, 69, 96, 0.4);\n}\nbutton {\n  margin-top: 8px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: #fff;\n  border-color: var(--accent);\n  transition: transform 0.05s, background 0.15s;\n}\nbutton:hover { background: #ff5c77; }\nbutton:active { transform: translate(2px, 2px); }\n#result {\n  display: block;\n  margin-top: 20px;\n  padding: 16px;\n  text-align: center;\n  font-size: 1.75rem;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  border: 3px dashed var(--muted);\n  word-break: break-all;\n}\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card { padding: 16px; }\n  h1 { font-size: 1.25rem; }\n  #result { font-size: 1.4rem; }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const leftInput = document.getElementById('left');\nconst rightInput = document.getElementById('right');\nconst operationSelect = document.getElementById('operation');\nconst calculateButton = document.getElementById('calculate');\nconst resultOutput = document.getElementById('result');\n\nfunction calculate() {\n  const leftRaw = leftInput.value.trim();\n  const rightRaw = rightInput.value.trim();\n  const left = Number(leftRaw);\n  const right = Number(rightRaw);\n\n  if (leftRaw === '' || rightRaw === '' || !Number.isFinite(left) || !Number.isFinite(right)) {\n    resultOutput.textContent = 'Error';\n    return;\n  }\n\n  const op = operationSelect.value;\n  let result;\n\n  switch (op) {\n    case 'add':\n      result = left + right;\n      break;\n    case 'subtract':\n      result = left - right;\n      break;\n    case 'multiply':\n      result = left * right;\n      break;\n    case 'divide':\n      if (right === 0) {\n        resultOutput.textContent = 'Error';\n        return;\n      }\n      result = left / right;\n      break;\n    default:\n      resultOutput.textContent = 'Error';\n      return;\n  }\n\n  if (!Number.isFinite(result)) {\n    resultOutput.textContent = 'Error';\n    return;\n  }\n\n  resultOutput.textContent = String(result);\n}\n\ncalculateButton.addEventListener('click', calculate);\n\n[leftInput, rightInput, operationSelect].forEach((el) => {\n  el.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n    if (e.key === 'Enter') {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      calculate();\n    }\n  });\n});\n",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Two-Number Calculator\n\nA pixel-styled, offline calculator that performs addition, subtraction, multiplication, and division on two numbers.\n\n## Features\n\n- Two number inputs (supports negative and decimal values)\n- Operation selector: add, subtract, multiply, divide\n- Displays only the numeric result (or exact text `Error`)\n- Rejects empty inputs, non-finite numbers, and division by zero\n- Keyboard accessible with labeled controls and visible focus states\n- Responsive down to 360px wide\n- No packages, network requests, or external assets\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter the left and right numbers.\n3. Choose an operation.\n4. Click **Calculate** (or press Enter in any input).\n5. The result appears in the output area.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — markup and required IDs\n- `styles.css` — pixel-style theme and responsive layout\n- `script.js` — calculation and validation logic\n\n## Error Handling\n\nThe output shows `Error` when:\n- Either input is empty\n- Either input is not a finite number\n- The operation is division and the right number is zero\n\n## License\n\nMIT",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
